etsy/data/ui/

# --- captured HTTP artefacts (2026-08-25) -------------------------------------
# A DevTools "copy as cURL" and a scraped logged-in dashboard both reached this
# repo carrying real credentials: a live `_pinterest_sess`, a csrftoken, an email
# and a fulfillment address. They read as documentation and are not. Anything
# captured from a logged-in browser is a credential until proven otherwise.
data/dashboard.html
*.har
**/copy-as-curl*
**/*dashboard*.html
